            "Pain you can't control, or vomiting so you can't keep fluids or tablets down — go to the emergency department.",
        ],
        improvementDefinition: "Being free of the stone (passed, or no significant pieces left on a scan) and its symptoms, usually checked about 1–3 months after treatment.",
        options: [
